---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../lib/urls';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" pageClass="not-found-page">
  <main id="main-content" class="not-found shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">404 / Missing page</p>
    <h1>这一页还没被收进馆藏。</h1>
    <p>链接可能已经改变，或文章仍在等待处理。</p>
    <a href={sitePath()}>返回博客书架 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
